{"data":{"repository":{"pullRequest":{"createdAt":"2026-10-10T15:01:59Z","lastEditedAt":null,"userContentEdits":{"nodes":[],"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":null}},"reviewThreads":{"nodes":[{"isResolved":false,"isOutdated":false,"comments":{"nodes":[{"databaseId":4238076829,"path":"h/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp","line":271,"body":"### K pair_base leaves token unbound\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`k_vnni::detail::pair_base` computes the scatter/gather address from `token` with no `token &lt; Rows` check, and `store_row` / `load_row` call it directly. Packed V asserts this in `v_vnni_access::pair_base` on every bulk op, including release builds. An out-of-range token here becomes a 64-dword scatter or gather off the 16 KiB plane.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 3a8ec5fb-0b75-4a28-b437-aa578de319ee -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nh/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp#L259-L271\nh/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp#L285-L317\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`h/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp#L285-L317`](https://github.com/positron-ai/tron/blob/a711aeee831c7c4da24ce3737d93dd0c76df1149/h/tron/tensor/k_vnni.hpp#L285-L317)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img al